{"version":1,"key":"card:587","content":{"id":587,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原型链是 JavaScript 实现继承的一种机制，当访问一个对象上不存在的属性时，会从它的原型上去查找。每一个对象上都存在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prototype ","code":true},{"text":"属性，指向的就是其原型对象，原型对象上也存在 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"prototype","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以发现，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prototype","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 形成了一条链表，这个通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prototype","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 形成的链表称为原型链，原型链的最顶端为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，它的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prototype","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"instanceof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符判断一个对象 A 是否是另一个对象 B 的实例，它的底层原理就是通过原型链实现的，即判断对象 B 的原型是否在对象 A 的原型链上，如果在，则说明 A 是 B 的实例。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function myInstanceOf(obj, constructor) {\n    // 基本类型直接返回 false\n    if (obj === null || typeof obj !== 'object' && typeof obj !== 'function') {\n        return false;\n    }\n    \n    // 获取对象的原型\n    let proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(obj);\n    \n    while (true) {\n        // 如果到达原型链顶端\n        if (proto === null) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        \n        // 如果找到了构造函数的 prototype\n        if (proto === constructor.prototype) {\n            return true;\n        }\n        \n        // 继续向上查找原型链\n        proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(proto);\n    }\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8ff1d2be-bdc2-43ec-bfad-aed7cb1155a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为对象设置原型的方法有这么几种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们通过 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1402,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":570,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"new"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个对象时，会自动将新创建对象的原型设置为构造函数的原型"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.create","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定新创建对象的原型"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.create(null)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个没有原型的对象。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.setPrototypeOf","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 修改对象的原型"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/原型"],"createTime":1745406104142,"updateTime":1748397144879,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1748397144879},"links":{"card:570":{"key":"card:570","type":"card","id":570}}}